      "messages": {
        "202290000": {
          "id": 202290000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "<u>真相只有一个，不是这个就是那个——这本《21道题告别低效推理》，我只花了0.99秒全学会了，超过了二相乐园99.99%的人，你也来试试吧</u>",
          "next": [
            202290001,
            202290003
          ]
        },
        "202290001": {
          "id": 202290001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "原来给书带货还得会量子速读？",
          "next": [
            202290002
          ]
        },
        "202290002": {
          "id": 202290002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "放马过来，我能更快",
          "next": [
            202290005
          ]
        },
        "202290003": {
          "id": 202290003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "这是给书带货的委托吗？",
          "next": [
            202290004
          ]
        },
        "202290004": {
          "id": 202290004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "来吧，我能赢你",
          "next": [
            202290005
          ]
        },
        "202290005": {
          "id": 202290005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "尝鲜版第一题：",
          "next": [
            202290006
          ]
        },
        "202290006": {
          "id": 202290006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "「夜里，受害者在厨房找吃的，只听『啪』的一声，他死了。」请你还原案情——",
          "next": [
            202290007,
            202290012,
            202290017
          ]
        },
        "202290007": {
          "id": 202290007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "饥肠辘辘的受害者潜入他人厨房准备饱餐一顿，不巧与察觉到异响的屋主人迎面撞上，被屋主击倒",
          "next": [
            202290008
          ]
        },
        "202290008": {
          "id": 202290008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "嗯，很合理的入室行窃。但你似乎漏掉了『啪』这一关键线索",
          "next": [
            202290009
          ]
        },
        "202290009": {
          "id": 202290009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "为什么是『啪』的一声，不是『啊』的一声？",
          "next": [
            202290010
          ]
        },
        "202290010": {
          "id": 202290010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "答案揭晓——",
          "next": [
            202290011
          ]
        },
        "202290011": {
          "id": 202290011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "受害者是一只蟑螂",
          "next": [
            202290021
          ]
        },
        "202290012": {
          "id": 202290012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "屋主饿得不行，因着急食用了变质的食物而身亡，『啪』的一声倒在了地上",
          "next": [
            202290013
          ]
        },
        "202290013": {
          "id": 202290013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "看似他杀，实则意外，逆转思维不错，可惜不对",
          "next": [
            202290014
          ]
        },
        "202290014": {
          "id": 202290014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "人，什么时候都会饿，什么时候都能吃，但题眼却强调「夜里」",
          "next": [
            202290015
          ]
        },
        "202290015": {
          "id": 202290015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "答案揭晓——",
          "next": [
            202290016
          ]
        },
        "202290016": {
          "id": 202290016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "受害者是一只蟑螂",
          "next": [
            202290021
          ]
        },
        "202290017": {
          "id": 202290017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "夜里…厨房…吃饭…『啪』的一声……",
          "next": [
            202290018
          ]
        },
        "202290018": {
          "id": 202290018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "受害者是一只蟑螂",
          "next": [
            202290019
          ]
        },
        "202290019": {
          "id": 202290019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我瞎猜的",
          "next": [
            202290020
          ]
        },
        "202290020": {
          "id": 202290020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "神探啊！",
          "next": [
            202290021
          ]
        },
        "202290021": {
          "id": 202290021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "我侦破的案件也大多如此，情理之中，又意料之外",
          "next": [
            202290022
          ]
        },
        "202290022": {
          "id": 202290022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "所以，教科书级别的推理工具书，你确定不来一本？",
          "next": [
            202290023
          ]
        },
        "202290023": {
          "id": 202290023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "再来一题感受一下：「受害者外出散步碰到长长绿绿的东西，意外身亡。」请你还原案情——",
          "next": [
            202290024
          ]
        },
        "202290024": {
          "id": 202290024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "呃…等一下",
          "next": [
            202290025
          ]
        },
        "202290025": {
          "id": 202290025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "拿成《脑筋急转弯》了",
          "next": [
            202290026
          ]
        },
        "202290026": {
          "id": 202290026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "也是一种推理书吧，能不能学到真东西另说",
          "next": [
            202290027
          ]
        },
        "202290027": {
          "id": 202290027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "没事",
          "next": [
            202290028
          ]
        },
        "202290028": {
          "id": 202290028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1504,
          "text": "这本，也在我的委托单里",
